# JudeanFloraV1; canonical UE cm (X east, +Y south, Z up), written with Y reflected and triangle winding reversed for the legacy OBJ importer adapter. One o object, no g groups, so the importer creates exactly one material slot.
# terebinth (Pistacia palaestina / P. atlantica), gnarled old variant, LOD0 leaf
# short leaning fluted bole with a twisted trunk; the habit of an old Judean olive, stylised, not a survey of any tree
o SM_JudeanFloraV1_Terebinth_Gnarled_L0_Leaf
